                <l xml:id="m-28ca7597-7db0-4e2c-841e-e2ab9e2cd4ad" facs="#m-0e624323-a70b-4ce7-9495-615c757077a8" label="text-like">Saturday in Ember Week of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-d1bc8ad7-e0c2-4cb5-affc-e9f87f8241f4" facs="#m-afcc19f4-b752-41ae-9339-75ba9c544431" label="ambiguous">348</l><l xml:id="m-080d9f22-73d3-41f1-8c24-b6a09bd8e5fb" facs="#m-60a48c36-77b1-46fb-9c22-5374af2eb401" label="ambiguous">Lesson V.</l><l xml:id="m-d1525ca8-5edb-466c-bf75-a8b68bcbe0df" facs="#m-b711dcf7-0a59-4be3-9422-22521fc70278" label="lyrics-like">Léctio Daniélis Prophétae. Dan. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-6aa04cf3-c6dc-424b-bb3b-73ef6407b1af" facs="#m-4c6fb478-2459-4e06-a624-11a91806ac9a" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Angelus Dómini quos réperit juxta fornácem de</l><l xml:id="m-f2c622f0-0c5d-4302-a3dc-07b1e3239cb4" facs="#m-b0b02aea-8b5d-4ad0-905a-4b848c4da77f" label="lyrics-like">L descéndit cum Azaría, et sóciis Chaldaéis ministros regis, qui eam</l><l xml:id="m-89e59d66-68f7-4935-9706-534126357c37" facs="#m-8f3f951f-8ae0-49ce-bf5a-48d7b3c84f7b" label="lyrics-like">incendébant. Et non tétigit eos</l><l xml:id="m-4ce0ffde-1c8c-44a5-ab55-73e474765632" facs="#m-3d4453a9-ff51-4e80-83fe-1fe96407ccd3" label="lyrics-like">ejus in fornácem: et excússit flam¬</l><l xml:id="m-bc5ebd1d-4a13-494a-84c1-4e62b8323c45" facs="#m-e91029a4-0952-4d73-8692-7449309b8ae1" label="lyrics-like">mam ignis de fornáce, et fecit mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8db2f0bd-ab12-4410-ab48-99dde28b5f44" facs="#m-8ca268d9-baa5-4220-8d32-9a1478e0d0dc" label="lyrics-like">omníno ignis, neque contristávit,</l><l xml:id="m-fc089ea1-07f4-42ed-a347-a8a369450248" facs="#m-c4aa3243-d7e5-46ae-b7de-1997c9888320" label="lyrics-like">nec quidquam moléstiae intulit.</l><l xml:id="m-25882c92-82b4-4280-92d3-469de64aa3ed" facs="#m-659aeb8d-284c-492c-8ff7-569de5e9dc87" label="lyrics-like">dium fornácis quasi ventum roris</l><l xml:id="m-94cad193-17e1-4a85-ab5f-6bed699e3d72" facs="#m-bad054e2-732b-4fd2-bbee-cf47ce3255f5" label="lyrics-like">flantem. Flamma autem effundebá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5fee6b4-ff4c-40bb-91dd-8a25b9ee06b1" facs="#m-097f6424-11bc-4221-b8e6-fa8978f1fbf5" label="ambiguous">Tunc hi tres quasi ex uno ore lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-02ee3196-fd3d-4c5c-a3cb-b7688b49b833" facs="#m-8163b557-b5a5-4611-aedb-5f15d2423f29" label="lyrics-like">tur super fornácem cúbitis quadra¬ dábant, et glorificábant, et bene¬</l><l xml:id="m-098e38a9-07b5-4dc2-863d-c4a40f0bfda4" facs="#m-a211fcec-8a69-4744-aa55-611a8b9e1c6b" label="lyrics-like">ginta novem: et erúpit, et incéndit! dicébant Deum in fornáce, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-a383e14a-bfb1-4244-a71c-2f3359d5b899" facs="#m-7eed2208-c514-4a63-981e-bbae99ba7872" label="ambiguous">Hymn</l><l xml:id="m-6f40c816-cd11-4163-a48d-905b760555ab" facs="#m-81406a98-cfc0-4330-97a6-5ed4916e101e" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-350e87b2-4a45-49bb-a9c9-0a63e87bc130" facs="#m-d6f4d3bb-d3d1-4fff-85ff-f3bd10f12b75" label="lyrics-like">E-nedíctus es Dómine Dé-us pátrum nostró-rum.</l><l xml:id="m-4300f662-1870-476e-a716-03ee1173190a" facs="#m-dc5a2663-2edd-4d41-9afc-1af35c0f81d0" label="lyrics-like">Et laudábi-lis et glo-ri-6-sus in saé-cu-la. 2. Et be¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1780848-a3c5-43c4-abb0-aaed9c4f0174" facs="#m-d8ade31f-1864-4970-95c3-805f86ab0086" label="lyrics-like">nedíctum nómen gló-ri-ae tú-ae, quod est sánctum. “Et lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-64a5416e-180b-4c08-b46b-ce227f58528e" facs="#m-677e6688-f1ec-4363-a808-c86b22a6dadb" label="lyrics-like">dábi-le et glo-ri-6-sum in saé-cu-la. 3. Be-nedíctus es</l><l xml:id="m-2822292f-91f4-477d-b492-21ff3d3e7594" facs="#m-b008c08a-b862-4349-9f9f-19d2f0b993e3" label="lyrics-like">in témplo sáncto gló-ri-ae tú- ae. * Et laudábi-lis et</l><l xml:id="m-0da32e5d-7500-406a-963b-678e7de1f755" facs="#m-70b87530-f822-42ba-80a0-e5d43ee47b28" label="lyrics-like">glo-ri-6́-sus in saé-cu-la. 4. Be-nedíctus es super thrónum</l><l xml:id="m-7d84efd1-118d-4f43-85b8-e9016cdc00e5" facs="#m-38da5bcf-6acb-418e-8d84-26c96922887d" label="lyrics-like">sánctum régni tú- . “Et laudábi-lis et glo-ri-6-sus</l><l xml:id="m-b60a3afa-8efd-405e-998c-b392b7fe1c57" facs="#m-e0c561bd-a3d9-462a-bb75-7b81810bd296" label="lyrics-like">in saé-cu-la. 5. Be-nedíctus es super scéptrum divi-ni-tá¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
